  "description": "The cover is dual-coated and made out of heavy-duty high-grade vinyl, with built-in horizontal crossbars that offer support when the cover is lying flat; and roll up with the tarp to provide full bed access when in need. Also comes with high-grade aluminum side rails-, and aluminum clamps for mounting to the truck bed.\nFitment\n2022-2026 Ford Maverick 4.5' Bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit: Factory brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precisly fit for the Ford Maverick 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 4.5' Bed\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly\nSafety First: Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of the side rails keep the cover close tightly; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving\nPremium Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with solid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your truck\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered",
